1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
This is NASA satellite data. Listen for the change.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Sea temperature around Mauritius, played as sound. Higher pitch means warmer water.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Strict mode: same data, no music added. Each value is only known to within 0.15 degrees.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
One date has no map. The pitch stops. The click keeps time. No data, not zero.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Every sound is also written, with its source. Ask something the record cannot say: "Not in this record."

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Data: NASA GIBS, JPL MUR. Built with AI help: see project page.
